 [17592186508187 1074 "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nUsing the second equation, we can isolate $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+y & =-5 \\\\ y & =-5-3x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $y=-5-3x$ into the first equation and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+3y & =2 \\\\ 3x+3(-5-3x) & =2 \\\\ 3x-15-9x & =2 \\\\ -6x-15 & =2 \\\\ -6x & =17 \\\\ x & =-\\frac{17}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $x=-\\frac{17}{6}$ into $y=-5-3x,$ we can then find the value of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =-5-3(-\\frac{17}{6}) \\\\ y & =\\frac{7}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $x=-\\frac{17}{6},\\,y=\\frac{7}{2}.$" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508188 1080 "\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508188 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508188 1083 #uuid "3eb5050b-2f97-532e-b6c8-5866bcc9fa51" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508189 1080 "-\\frac{17}{6}" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508189 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508189 1083 #uuid "3f39f41a-cfb3-5bf0-b58f-8d17841342c6" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508190 1075 #edb/ref 17592186508195 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508190 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508190 1077 "field-2" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508190 1078 #edb/ref 17592186508195 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508190 1079 #uuid "40fbd52d-5989-56ab-8589-60d240620d11" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508191 1075 #edb/ref 17592186508176 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508191 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508191 1077 "field-1" 13194139535461 17592186045443 true] [17592186508191 1078 #edb/ref 17592186508176 13194139535461 1759